  "overview": [
    "A restorative journey across Karnataka — from Chamundi Hill in Mysuru to the carved Hoysala temples of Belur and Halebeedu, through the forests of the Western Ghats, and down to the quiet sacred beaches of the Konkan coast.",
    "Unhurried days, comfortable stays and time by the sea at Murudeshwar and Gokarna make this a gentle mix of pilgrimage and renewal. A private vehicle and all meals are included."
